msgctxt "1356_Kiryu"
msgid "(There must be some reason he's crying.)"
msgstr "(Tiene que haber alguna razón por la que llora.)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1368_Kiryu"
msgid "You said he's been crying for an hour, right? He probably\\r\njust needs a nap."
msgstr "Dices que lleva una hora llorando, ¿no? Puede que \\r\nnecesite dormir la siesta."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1380_Date"
msgid "What, you think it's because he's tired? Can't he just stop\\r\ncrying and go to sleep, then?"
msgstr "¿Piensas que es porque está cansado? ¿No puede,\\r\nsimplemente, dejar de llorar y dormirse?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1392_Kiryu"
msgid "You really don't know the first thing about kids, Date-san.\\r\nIf you don't make a baby feel like he's back in his mother's\\r\nwomb, he'll never be able to sleep."
msgstr "De verdad que no tienes ni la menor idea sobre niños, Date.\\r\nSi no haces que el bebé se sienta como dentro del útero\\r\nde su madre, nunca se dormirá."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1404_Kiryu"
msgid "On that note, it's way too cold in here. Think you can turn\\r\nthe heat up?"
msgstr "A propósito, aquí hace mucho frío. ¿Podrías poner la\\r\ncalefacción?"

